    authority: >
      This explicit typed fixture replaces and invalidates every earlier fixed-count/topology
      constant. Counts and topological order are observed diagnostics only and are never
      acceptance evidence.
    required_coverage: >
      Convert every fixture ref to (source.kind, field, target.kind), deduplicate, sort by
      UTF-8 code point, and require exact set equality with allowed_edges. Every target ID
      must exist; every ref must be registered; Kahn must visit every fixture node.
