      - report_phase and report_final are separate from contract_phase and contract_final.
      - phase_projection_01 through phase_projection_06 are six distinct final inputs.
      - snapshot_before and snapshot_after bind different immutable projection bytes.
      - gate_001 through gate_010 are stage-specific meta-evidence and not GATE-005 subjects.
